{"id":"8251b2f9fd838667","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-rel-arith.md","title":"相对算术层级","display":"df-rel-arith — 相对算术层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-rel-arith","aliases":["20-df-rel-arith"],"display":"df-rel-arith — 相对算术层级","chapter":"4","section":"4.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 4.4.1","source_pdf_pages":[127],"source_printed_pages":[91],"depends_on":["[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-relative-ce]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-rel-arith"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-rel-arith</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rel-arith — 相对算术层级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 4.4.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rel\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^A_{0,k}=\\Pi^A_{0,k}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_k^A\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^A_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\ ((\\vec x,y)\\in B)\\}:B\\in\\Pi^A_{n,k+1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^A_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus B:B\\in\\Sigma^A_{n+1,k}\\},\\quad\n\\Delta^A_{n,k}:=\\Sigma^A_{n,k}\\cap\\Pi^A_{n,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^A_n:=\\Sigma^A_{n,1},\\quad\\Pi^A_n:=\\Pi^A_{n,1},\\quad\\Delta^A_n:=\\Delta^A_{n,1}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rel\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^A_{0,k}=\\Pi^A_{0,k}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_k^A\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^A_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\ ((\\vec x,y)\\in B)\\}:B\\in\\Pi^A_{n,k+1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^A_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus B:B\\in\\Sigma^A_{n+1,k}\\},\\quad\n\\Delta^A_{n,k}:=\\Sigma^A_{n,k}\\cap\\Pi^A_{n,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^A_n:=\\Sigma^A_{n,1},\\quad\\Pi^A_n:=\\Pi^A_{n,1},\\quad\\Delta^A_n:=\\Delta^A_{n,1}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基底中的特征函数自动全定义。相对层级仅由 oracle 度决定，因为等价 oracle 可以互相模拟全部矩阵。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 4.4.1；印刷页 91；PDF 第 127 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-